1
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:04,613
MoveBooks AI is built on Google Cloud and powered by Gemini AI.

2
00:00:04,793 --> 00:00:10,067
It guides accounting migration from readiness assessment through
verified first productive use.

3
00:00:10,247 --> 00:00:16,155
This walkthrough focuses on readiness, account meaning and the
human checkpoints before any books move.

4
00:00:16,335 --> 00:00:20,361
The workspace sequence uses a recorded local synthetic example.

5
00:00:22,467 --> 00:00:23,943
We begin with Understand.

6
00:00:24,103 --> 00:00:30,518
The public demo introduces Harbor Light Books, a fictional shop,
and the questions to resolve before moving

7
00:00:30,518 --> 00:00:31,058
anything.

8
00:00:31,218 --> 00:00:37,119
For the detailed workspace journey, we now switch to a recording
of the real application working with local

9
00:00:37,119 --> 00:00:38,002
synthetic books.

10
00:00:38,847 --> 00:00:43,071
This is a recorded example with synthetic books, not a new
production migration.

11
00:00:43,231 --> 00:00:47,050
The user reviews source records, readiness and the proposed
scope.

12
00:00:47,210 --> 00:00:50,742
Missing information needs attention before the plan progresses.

13
00:00:50,902 --> 00:00:56,359
The purpose is to make the risks visible early, while the user
still controls what happens next.

14
00:00:58,533 --> 00:01:01,736
Prepare turns that understanding into a migration plan.

15
00:01:01,896 --> 00:01:06,903
An account name alone is not enough: the destination must
preserve the meaning of the source.

16
00:01:07,063 --> 00:01:12,425
The existing mapping view brings suggested matches, confidence
and review status together.

17
00:01:12,585 --> 00:01:16,988
Ambiguous or sensitive choices still need a person to examine
the evidence.

18
00:01:17,148 --> 00:01:21,953
This recorded example shows the separate human decisions around
mappings and the plan.

19
00:01:22,148 --> 00:01:24,937
These are recorded decisions, not new approvals.

20
00:01:25,097 --> 00:01:30,650
A suggestion is not consent, and approving a plan is distinct
from accepting an explanation.

21
00:01:32,833 --> 00:01:33,800
MoveBooks AI.

22
00:01:33,980 --> 00:01:34,923
Move your books.

23
00:01:35,103 --> 00:01:36,370
Keep your confidence.
